---
/** Automated Collection — what each side owes before departure. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>Before departure · Nairobi</b><small>12 days to go</small></div>
  <div class="mk-meter"><i style="width:60%"></i></div>
  <div class="mk-row" data-live="tick" data-on="In" data-off="Asked" data-off-amber="false"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Passport details</b><small>From the traveller</small></div><span class="mk-tag">In</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row" data-live="tick" data-on="In" data-off="Asked" data-off-amber="false"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Vouchers · Rift Valley</b><small>From the supplier</small></div><span class="mk-tag">In</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row" data-live="tick" data-on="In" data-off="Asked" data-off-amber="false"><span class="mk-chk wait"></span><div><b>Arrival flight number</b><small>Due in 4 days</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Asked</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Driver contact · Acacia</b><small>Late · flagged to you</small></div><button type="button" class="mk-btn amb" data-live="set" data-done="Chased" data-small="Third reminder · just now">Chase</button></div>
</div>
